{title: Spirit of Power}
{subtitle: 2 Timothy 1:7}
{key: Bb}
{tempo: 108}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Bbmaj7] | [Bbmaj7] | [Gm7] | [Cm7] |
| [F7sus4] | [Bbmaj7] | [Gm7] | [Cm7] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F7sus4]Recalling [Bbmaj7]your tears, I long to [Gm7]see you
So that [Cm7]I may be filled with [F7sus4]joy
Re[Bbmaj7]minded of your sincere [Gm7]faith
[Cm7]Lived first in your grandmother [F7sus4]Lois
And your [Bbmaj7]mother Eunice, I am con[Gm7]vinced
It [Cm7]lives in you as [F7sus4]well
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
[Dm7]That is why I re[Gm7]mind you
To [Cm7]fan into flame the [F7sus4]gift of God
[Dm7]That is in you [Gm7]through the laying on
Of [Cm7]my hands upon your [F7sus4]head
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Bbmaj7]For God did not [Gm7]give us a spirit of timidi[Cm7]ty
But of power [F7sus4]and love and self-[Bbmaj7]con-trol
So do not be ashamed [Gm7]of the testimo[Cm7]ny
About our Lord, [F7sus4]or of me his priso[Bbmaj7]ner
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Instrumental}
| [Bbmaj7] | [Gm7] | [Cm7] | [F7sus4] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
In[Bbmaj7]stead, share in suffering for the gospel [Gm7]
By the [Cm7]power of God who saved [F7sus4]us
And [Bbmaj7]called us with a holy call[Gm7]ing
Not be[Cm7]cause of our works, but his [F7sus4]own
[Dm7]Purpose [Gm7]and grace, given [Cm7]in Christ Jesus
Be[F7sus4]fore time be[Bbmaj7]gan, [Bbmaj7]now revealed
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
For God did not give [Gm7]us a spirit of timidity
[Cm7]But of power and [F7sus4]love and self-con-[Bbmaj7]trol
So do not be ashamed of the [Gm7]testimony
A[Cm7]bout our Lord, or [F7sus4]of me his priso[Bbmaj7]ner
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
Through [Eb]the appearing of [Dm7]our Savior Jesus [Cm7]Christ
Who [Eb]abolished death [Dm7]and brought life to [Cm7]light
And im[Eb]mortality through the [Dm7]gospel
Now [Cm7]made clear to our [F7sus4]eyes
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Bb]For God did not give us a [Gm7]spirit of timidity
But [Cm7]of power and love [F7sus4]and self-con-trol
[Bbmaj7]So do not be ashamed of the [Gm7]testimony
A[Cm7]bout our Lord, or [F7sus4]of me his priso[Bbmaj7]ner
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Instrumental}
| [Bbmaj7] | [Gm7] | [Cm7] | [F7sus4] |

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Bbmaj7]Power and [Gm7]love and self-con-[Cm7]trol
The [F7sus4]spirit of God in [Bbmaj7]you
{end_of_verse}

